## Code Example

```javascript
// Sample decision-tracking template
function deprecationPlan(options, metrics) {
  // options: 'soft' vs 'hard'
  // metrics: { usage, latency, errors, sla }
  // returns recommended path and rollback plan
  return {
    recommended: options.soft,
    rollback: options.hard,
    actions: []
  };
}

